 WE HAVE SEEN THAT MAN ON THE AVERAGE DOES NOT LIVE ABOVE
 TWO-AND-TWENTY YEARS.  DURING THESE TWO AND TWENTY
 YEARS HE IS LIABLE TO TWO AND TWENTY THOUSAND EVILS,
