 MEN STILL STRUT AND POSE ON THE STAGE OF LIFE.
 THEY MAKE LOVE AT THE RISK OF DESTRUCTION,
 INTRIGUE, CARRY ON WAR, AND FORM PROJECTS, JUST AS IF THEY
 WERE TO LIVE IN LUXURY AND HAPPINESS FOR A THOUSAND
 AGES.

